<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.25 PCT  MATURITY    15.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
